s":"American (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"b92dSNftvCSPWLC4ZgNXCg","review_id":"uPTVi6ed1QORhyeewqXaXg","date":"2010-10-08T01:43:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9192498922348022,"text_excerpt":"Today I stopped in during the lunch rush and had surprisingly fast service with a packed house. The food was wonderful of course! Catfish, mac and Cheese and jambalaya, my usual! It was way better this time seems like. They also have a new televised menu set up.. All types of coolness!"},{"business_id":"b92dSNftvCSPWLC4ZgNXCg","review_id":"lxuZiIIKJV80HzdtJfCm8g","date":"2013-09-11T14:23:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9186053276062012,"text_excerpt":"Sammy's is the kind of place you would never pick out of a crowd. It sits unassumingly on Elysian Fields nestled closely to all the finest of fast food and gas stations, however, inside lies some of the greatest lunch delights! Since I work nearby, Sammy's is my go to lunch spot when I \"forget\" to bring my own for the day. They have a rather extensive menu including sandwiches, poboys, soups, salads, sides, and entrees. All of it is delicious! I have had most of the food options here and everything has been excellent, which makes it hard to pick my favorite but I will try: 1. Grilled Shrimp Poboy. Sammy's knows how to cook shrimp! I am super picky about shrimp and most places overcook the..."},{"business_id":"b92dSNftvCSPWLC4ZgNXCg","review_id":"mTAqvrIrX9mf3HHTGuFQbg","date":"2011-01-26T21:04:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9175437688827515,"text_excerpt":"Sammy's has a huge menu and mostly everything tastes great. This place will be around for a lond time. You might want to call your order in over the phone if you are doing takeout. I was surprised at how well they manage the crowd they had. It is a great lunch place. don't know if they are open for dinner. The stuff crab cakes will make you come back again."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"b92dSNftvCSPWLC4ZgNXCg","photo_id":"JHpzXIczJq9xHfJUKcq0gg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JHpzXIczJq9xHfJUKcq0gg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
